   'FAQ and compliance bulletins',\n    50→      ],\n    51→    },\n    52→    {\n    53→      name: 'ENFORCEMENT ACTIONS',\n    54→      items: [\n    55→        'SEC, DOJ, FTC enforcement actions',\n    56→        'State AG actions',\n    57→        'Consent decrees and settlements',\n    58→        'Criminal prosecutions',\n    59→      ],\n    60→    },\n    61→    {\n    62→      name: 'LITIGATION HISTORY',\n    63→      items: [\n    64→        'Active lawsuits and proceedings',\n    65→        'Class action filings',\n    66→        'Qui tam and whistleblower cases',\n    67→        'Arbitration and alternative dispute resolution',\n    68→      ],\n    69→    },\n    70→    {\n    71→      name: 'LEGAL COMMENTARY',\n    72→      items: [\n    73→        'Law review articles and legal scholarship',\n    74→        'Bar association publications',\n    75→        'Legal blog analysis',\n    76→        'Expert commentary',\n    77→      ],\n    78→    },\n    79→    {\n    80→      name: 'REGULATORY FILINGS',\n    81→      items: [\n    82→        'SEC filings (8-K, 10-K risk factors)',\n    83→        'Lobbying disclosures',\n    84→        'Comment letters on proposed rules',\n    85→        'Patent and trademark filings',\n    86→      ],\n    87→    },\n    88→    {\n    89→      name: 'CONTRACTUAL ANALYSIS',\n    90→      items: [\n    91→        'Standard contract terms in this area',\n    92→        'Key contractual provisions',\n    93→        'Industry standard agreements',\n    94→        'Licensing and IP arrangements',\n    95→      ],\n    96→    },\n    97→    {\n    98→      name: 'COMPLIANCE REQUIREMENTS',\n    99→      items: [\n   100→        'Regulatory compliance checklists',\n   101→        'Industry standards and best practices',\n   102→        'Self-regulatory organization rules',\n   103→        'International compliance requirements',\n   104→      ],\n   105→    },\n   106→    {\n   107→      name: 'LEGAL TRENDS',\n   108→      items: [\n   109→        'Proposed legislation',\n   110→        'Regulatory reform initiatives',\n   111→        'Emerging legal theories',\n   112→        'Judicial appointment impacts',\n   113→      ],\n   114→    },\n   115→    {\n   116→      name: 'REGULATORY CAPTURE ANALYSIS',\n   117→      items: [\n   118→        'Revolving door between regulators and regulated entities',\n   119→        'Funding sources for legal scholarship and amicus briefs',\n   120→        'Lobbying expenditures related to relevant regulations',\n   121→        'Agency enforcement patterns and potential selective enforcement',\n   122→      ],\n   123→    },\n   124→  ],\n   125→\n   126→  searchDepthGuidance: {\n   127→    quick: 'Focus on most relevant cases and current regulations',\n   128→    standard: 'Balanced coverage of cases, regulations, and enforcement',\n   129→    deep: 'Comprehensive legal research including commentary and trends',\n   130→  },\n   131→\n   132→  // ---- Extraction Phase Configuration ----\n   133→  extractionIntro:\n   134→    'You are a legal research analyst extracting key findings for legal analysis. CRITICAL: Use EXACT finding_type values specified below - they map to UI components.',\n   135→\n   136→  findingTypes: [\n   137→    {\n   138→      name: 'evidence',\n   139→      displayName: 'Case Law',\n   140→      description:\n   141→        'Court decisions and holdings. Include: case name, court, date, holding. Note precedential value and applicability.',\n   142→      extractedDataSchema:\n   143→        '{\"case_name\": \"...\", \"court\": \"...\", \"date\": \"...\", \"citation\": \"...\", \"holding\": \"...\", \"precedential_value\": \"binding/persuasive\"}',\n   144→      analysisFallback:\n   145→        'This case law finding is relevant for establishing legal precedent in the matter at hand.',\n   146→    },\n   147→    {\n   148→      name: 'fact',\n   149→      displayName: 'Statutes and Regulations',\n   150→      description:\n   151→     